-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.00.7695<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 03, 2018<br/>Winter Update 2018</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181107123138&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energized_Limb_de9a82.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an energized limb <span class=\"p-attributes\">(magic level +1, protection energy +10%)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot, Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 3 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids of level 180 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 27.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Among the most powerful weapons available for a sub-200 mage, comparable to the Deepling Ceremonial Dagger (which does less damage but has longer range). Both Druids and Sorcerers can use this weapon and it's the only fire based rod available for the former.\n</p><p>It is not possible to imbue this item with critical hit imbuements.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td